Forked at commit 5a7c907 (tagged `upstream-baseline` in this repository),
corresponding to Edge-Drop v0.2.2.

hovr keeps Edge-Drop's transparent edge-anchored window, hover-expand interaction
and Electron/React structure, and replaces its clipboard-manager functionality with
a usage-limits notch for AI coding tools. Files inherited from Edge-Drop have been
modified; see `git diff upstream-baseline` for the complete set of changes.

The provider usage logic (which endpoints each tool exposes, the Antigravity
conversation-database field layout and model-id table) follows what T3 Code does:

